<title>USA: Wet Seal ends bid for County Seat stores.</title>
<headline>Wet Seal ends bid for County Seat stores.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Wet Seal Inc on Friday said it has ended its bid to acquire County Seat Stores locations due to County Seat's lack of selling interest at a price Wet Seal is willing to pay.</p>
<p>In December Wet Seal had launched its bid for over 500 of County Seat Stores locations.</p>
<p>Wet Seal, however, will continue pursuing an agressive growth strategy with 30 new store locations planned for opening in 1997 and 75 in 1998, it said in a statement.</p>
</text>
